{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Vigilante</strong> is an immersive <strong>interactive fiction adventure</strong> presented in a <strong>graphic novel</strong> style. Step into the role of The Vigilante on a relentless hunt for a ruthless drug lord and a sadistic serial killer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story unfolds, <strong>you control the narrative</strong>\u2014every decision you make shapes your path. Choose wisely, as your actions can unlock new storylines, forge unexpected alliances, or lead you to a sudden, deadly end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>multiple branching storylines</strong>, <strong>life-and-death decisions</strong>, and <strong>several unique endings</strong>, this is more than just a story\u2014it's <strong>your own gripping, choose-your-own-adventure</strong>. Read, decide, and <strong>become The Vigilante</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3602980?t=1745319377","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602980/a5e6e7a803c3b83141973434c275a3bcc2373d09/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745319377","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602980/0c6ba6d5ea457683a41603450e4177007b98fcb8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745319377","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602980/0c6ba6d5ea457683a41603450e4177007b98fcb8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745319377","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Depictions of violence, mainly the use of firearms. References to drug smuggling and illegal drug use. One storyline features references to a serial killer who uses a knife to kill homeless people."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Vigilante</strong> is an immersive <strong>interactive fiction adventure</strong> prese